BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wyxr-event-cb0c9f81-3282-4fa0-b76d-44885d8003e2@concert-calendar.wyxr.o
 rg
DTSTAMP:20261029T143338Z
DTSTART:20261205T190000Z
DTEND:20261205T220000Z
SUMMARY:WYXR's Raised By Sound Fest - Wednesday\, Patterson Hood\, Sylvan E
 sso DJ Set\, Hand Habits\, Chanel Beads and more! — Crosstown Arts
LOCATION:Crosstown Arts\, Memphis\, TN
DESCRIPTION:Show 1p\nWednesday (solo) + Patterson Hood\nTwo Southern storyt
 elling powerhouses join forces for an intimate set to raise funds for WYXR
 . It’s only fitting that they co-headline the station’s biggest fundra
 iser since they’re the embodiment of the independent and unconventional 
 spirit of WYXR. This will be the first full show featuring Karly Hartzman 
 (Wednesday) and Patterson Hood (Drive-By Truckers) and it’s sure to be h
 eavy on the Memphis love (they’ve performed Big Star and Chris Bell tune
 s live) and light on the formality.  Don’t miss it.\n\nEast Atrium\n\nSy
 lvan Esso DJ Set\nSaturday\, Dec. 5 \nDoors 8:30 pm – Show 9 – 11 pm\n
 You might know Sylvan Esso (Amelia Meath and Nick Sanborn) by their catchy
 \, electro-pop tunes\, most recently their incredible new album Ow ∞. Th
 e two have also been making waves as a DJ duo with discerning Reddit users
  describing their DJ sets as “nonstop\, absolute riots” and “great b
 angers back to back.” This will be their first performance in Memphis in
  what’s quickly become a can’t-miss\, fan favorite at the fest. Your a
 fter-party ticket gets you complimentary food by Go-Time Group (Fawn\, Cam
 eo\, Mary’s B.O.T.E.\, No Comment)\, wine\, beer\, cocktails\, art exper
 iences and more. Your VIP ticket to Saturday’s headline show of Wednesda
 y (solo) and Patterson Hood includes after party access.\n\nCentral & East
  Atrium\nSpend the day at Raised By Sound Fest for free live music from 1 
 to 6:30 pm along with community tables featuring local organizations lifti
 ng up the arts\, animal rescue\, music and much more. Family and dog frien
 dly!\n\n5:15 pm\nCentral Atrium\nChanel Beads\nAn experimental dream pop p
 roject by New York-based Shane Levers\, Chanel Beads makes their first app
 earance in Memphis at Raised By Sound Fest. Their June 2026 sophomore albu
 m\, Your Day Will Come (same title as their first album)\, earned praise f
 rom renowned Indie Music staples NME\, Pitchfork and Paste. \n\n\n3:55 pm\
 nEast Atrium\nHand Habits\nWYXR is elated to present the Memphis debut of 
 Hand Habits\, aka Meg Duffy. Their contributions to collaboration and comm
 unity in the Indie music world are right in line with WYXR. Along with the
 ir incredible solo project\, Hand Habits\, they’ve brought their immense
  swiss-army-like talents (vocals\, keys\, bass\, guitar\, slide) and visio
 n to work by Kevin Morby\, The War on Drugs\, Perfume Genius\, and more.\n
 \n\n2:50 pm\nEast Atrium\nOut On The Eaves\nThe current creative venture b
 y Memphis mainstay\, Patrick Carey\, is a stunning display of psychedelic 
 folk and pop. Patrick cut his teeth in Athens\, Georgia\, but since landin
 g in Memphis\, has become embedded in the local arts scene and has release
 d two exceptional albums as Out On The Eaves. His 2026 release\, With No R
 eflection\, is a revelation and was launched at a release party with none 
 other than Bonnie “Prince” Billy.\n\n\n2 pm\nCentral Atrium\nMarcella 
 Simien + Qemist\nOn their own\, Marcella and Qemist are beloved\, prolific
  and ground-breaking Memphis artists. Together\, their powers double.  Swa
 mp Soul Queen Marcella’s transcendent vocals soar over Qemist’s infect
 ious\, perfectly layered beats and melodies. It’s something to behold. T
 his is the first performance of its kind\, with visual and stylistic surpr
 ises in store.\n\n\n1 pm\nCentral Atrium\nBlue Tom Revue\nThe only perform
 ance that’s kicked off Raised By Sound Fest since the very beginning. Th
 ese young artists historically go on to BIG things – including spots at 
 RIVERBEAT and Mempho Fest. It’s your chance to see the future of Memphis
  music for free – and you can say “I saw them when . . .”\nTickets: 
 https://raisedbysoundfest.com\nhttps://concert-calendar.wyxr.org/e/cb0c9f8
 1-3282-4fa0-b76d-44885d8003e2
URL:https://raisedbysoundfest.com
CATEGORIES:WYXR Presents,WYXR Pick
LAST-MODIFIED:20261029T143412Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
